mpire of Adrestia is part of the fictional continent of F\u00f3dlan in the video game, Fire Emblem: Three Houses, and its spin-off, Fire Emblem Warriors: Three Hopes.\n\n*Wilhelm Paul Hresvelg\n**He was the first"
